pydebuprep (0.13.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New format confluence-cloud: Markdown for pasting into Confluence Cloud,
    whose editor shows wiki markup as plain text. It is the same as jira-cloud,
    but has no size limit, so pages keep the full report.
  * New format confluence-legacy: the existing wiki markup, for on-prem
    Confluence. --format confluence is another name for it, so existing
    commands and configurations keep working. Use confluence-cloud if you are
    on Confluence Cloud. A host needs this version before a portal's config
    can set either new format; older versions reject it.
  * The labels in the report header (Host, OS, Kernel, Machine, Generated,
    Baseline and Config) are now bold in Markdown and HTML too.
  * The report format is unchanged: portal 0.3.0 and newer take these
    reports.

